        "text": "Hi, welcome to Binance Academy's Trading and Investing Strategies course. Now you've hopefully got a grasp of the basic concepts of trading and investing, let's dive deeper into the different ways you can trade. We'll begin this course with the first module on portfolio and risk management. So what is portfolio management? Your portfolio is a collection of assets and investments. Just like you can strategically manage your individual investments, you can also strategically manage your portfolio as a whole. A portfolio can contain real estate stocks, cryptocurrencies, and even trading cards. Anything you invest in can be part of your portfolio. If you're only trading cryptocurrencies, it will likely be made up of a combination of Bitcoin and other altcoins. Each part of your portfolio can work together and contribute to an overall strategy.",
